==== Serial port ====

Serial console is on the 2x5 pin header with the following pinout:
<code>
RT2880                          Wi-Fi
        [TX] [VCC]
        []   []
        []   []
        [RX] [GND]
</code>

Serials console baudrate is : 57600,8n1


